      "source": "<a href=\"KeyspaceConfiguration.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.core.convert\"><code>KeyspaceConfiguration</code></a> allows programmatic setup of keyspaces and time to live options for certain types. This\nis suitable for cases where there is no option to use the equivalent <a href=\"../RedisHash.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.data.redis.core\"><code>RedisHash</code></a> or <a href=\"../TimeToLive.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.data.redis.core\"><code>TimeToLive</code></a>\nannotations.",
      "translation": "<a href=\"KeyspaceConfiguration.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.core.convert\"><code>KeyspaceConfiguration</code></a> 允许通过编程方式配置特定类型的键空间和生存时间选项。在无法使用等效的 <a href=\"../RedisHash.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.data.redis.core\"><code>RedisHash</code></a> 或 <a href=\"../TimeToLive.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.data.redis.core\"><code>TimeToLive</code></a> 注解的情况下，这种方式非常适用。",
